    "representation": "lean4-declaration",
    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 11]\ntheorem erdos_13.variants.general : answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ r : ℕ, ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ N : ℕ,\n    ∀ A ⊆ Icc 1 N,\n    (∀ a ∈ A, ∀ (b : Fin r → ℕ), (∀ i, b i ∈ A) → (∀ i, a < b i) →\n      ¬ (a ∣ ∑ i, b i)) →\n    (A.card : ℝ) ≤ (N : ℝ) / (r + 1) + C",
